   "text": "the record finds the continuous time in the vacuum sector only (Z72), while a non-zero birefringence needs a state that is not the SU(2,2)-invariant vacuum; a complete solution has to show both in one object: the representation is the ladder, the world state is not its vacuum"
  },
  {
   "statements": [
    "family_is_twistor"
   ],
   "text": "the record reads the family three-space in two ways: as the Cartan lattice of A3 with the clock as Coxeter element (SEL.THM.01, QGEO.STATE.01; in sl(4) the class with Ad-spectrum (3,4,4,4)) and as the Moebius algebra of the seam line with the clock -Ad(rho4) (h6h33, FLAV.QGEO.04; rho4 has (7,4,0,4)).  Both give the signature (1,-1,-1) for the square of the clock, but they are different subspaces of sl(4) with clocks in different classes; a complete solution has to say which one is the A3 factor of E8.  The reading does not deliver the transport numbers: Q, K, R, L commute with no clock of the integer D4 (v98, v146), and Q+ is not the character degree there"
  }
